  "description": "The application is a carefully considered, high-quality scheme tailored to its location, to transform the playground into an attractive, rich, and imaginative play experience for key stages to explore, play and be inspired. \nThe scheme’s design considers the neighbouring context in terms of the built-up area with overlooking balconies and residences, noise and screening, colours and material palette and heights, (as well as comments made by local residents to the previously refurbished games court and MUGA play area and as a result of the public consultation for these proposals) and relevant planning policy and community plans providing a proposal, which enhances its immediate surroundings and provides high-quality open play space. \nRegarding the Fire Statement: \nThe building is neither higher than 18m ( 7 stores)  nor contains more than one dwelling so we understand that no fire statement is mandatory.",
